        :rulingText """If you don’t play the card, it will remain exiled."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2023-04-14"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Playing the card exiled with Hedron Detonator follows the normal rules for playing that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if the card is a creature card, you can cast that card by paying its mana cost only during your main phase while the stack is empty."""@en ] ,
