    :isInSet :MarchOfTheMachineCommander ;
    :cardNumber "241"^^xsd:integer ;
    :artist "Jung Park" ;
    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :printedText """At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control an artifact, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.
Whenever one or more artifact creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card."""@en ;
    :oracleText """At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control an artifact, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.
Whenever one or more artifact creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card."""@en ;
